inally under  appreciated for what it brings to the  table it's the complete package and if  you picked up a show this year from what  I recommend This Is It this is what peak  anime in 2019 looks like now with the  year just about wrapping up these are my  recommendations for non sequels this  2019 that's it for now I'd love to see  you next time for more content like this  make sure to hit the subscribe button  and click the bell button so you're  first in line for new Vinny Tube content  [Music]

